    "launch-limits-2026-11-19": "Owner, 2026-11-19: the bridge windows and caps are delegated to the coordinator, the external audit is done after launch, and the key ceremony goes ahead. Coordinator, 2026-11-19: Ethereum cap 500,000 USDC and window 50,000 USDC per 24 h; Arbitrum One, OP Mainnet and Linea cap 250,000 and window 25,000; every other route unchanged. Agent 410 (round 20) applied it in the integration tree because the limits became a field of the EVM launch registry and of the owner's ceremony kit: tools/evm-nets (registry record, generator, tests, fork rehearsal), the three networks' generated deployment files, and the ceremony kit, its test and its document (limits held value by value; audit wording; the state of the L2). Base and BNB Smart Chain files are not changed. docs/BRIDGE-ALLNETS.md section 7."
